# Outfit body (R18): a rain poncho that steps out from narrow shoulders to a wide hem in four clean tiers (a square
# frustum over the torso; a round cone stepped noisily), accent hem band and front stripe, one glow stripe.
# Torso inside x 4..10, y 3..11 (pivot 7 7 0 on spine_03, hung lower than the vest).
name outfit_poncho
grid 5
size 14 14 12
slot cloth SwatchMain
slot hem SwatchAccent
slot glow SwatchGlow
box 0 0 0 14 14 3 cloth
box 1 1 3 13 13 6 cloth
box 2 1 6 12 13 9 cloth
box 3 2 9 11 12 12 cloth
carve box 0 0 0 1 1 3
carve box 13 0 0 14 1 3
carve box 0 13 0 1 14 3
carve box 13 13 0 14 14 3
carve box 4 3 0 10 11 11
carve box 5 5 11 9 9 12
paint box 0 0 0 14 14 1 hem
paint box 6.5 0 0 7.5 14 12 hem
paint box 0 0 4 14 14 5 glow
pivot 7 7 0
